    "body": "Issue sweep: removed `blocked` because #3339 closed in PR #3871 (merge commit `925318141`).\n\nThis issue is partly done on `upstream/main`:\n- PR #3871 (`c07eee4d1`) moved `WireContourOp.start` into `WireContourOp.picks` and added legacy `start` migration in `WireContourDto`.\n- Still open: `PickCapability::Threading` accepts start picks only. Wire Contour does not accept or apply exit picks on open runs or closed profiles.\n- Still open: a load test that opens a legacy `start` file and verifies a byte-identical path.\n- Still open: pin tests for an exit pick on an open run, for a refused impossible pick, and for undo and redo.",
