    "body": "fix on issue/3332-wire-exit-pick · PR #3957 · pinned by wire_post::exit_pick (6 tests), wire_dxf_selection::exit_pick (2 tests), mcp_wire_contour::edit_operation_sets_the_wire_exit_pick_and_refuses_one_it_cannot_hold, motion wire_edm::exit (5 tests) · merges when reviewed\n\nNotes for the review:\n\n- An exit pick with tabs, skims, a taper, a burnout or a 4-axis cut is refused by name. The decision file `docs/decisions/3332-wire-exit-pick.md` gives the reason for each.\n- PR #3617 changes the same generator files in other functions. The PR body names the overlap.\n- The Wire Contour page has no exit row yet. `edit_operation` sets the pick.\n",
